ignored. Wrong-attempt and wrong-target receipts also cannot suppress it.

R2: scripts/landing.py:42 scopes the full landing/resource-ledger fixtures to
d5002 landing machinery and its fixtures; ordinary harness-submodule.py changes
skip them. The positive witness changes landing.py itself. scripts/ci-local.sh
