R3: scripts/formal.py:360 hashes each exported TLA/configuration/native graph,
expectation, contract metadata and full tool-pin map. A validated green archive
publishes an atomic per-key pointer. Identical models reuse its reference verdict
and carry reused_from; changed or missing inputs re-check. Every run still
exports all models and writes fresh candidate-SHA/input-bound evidence.
Presubmit and disjoint-source refresh opt in. scripts/ci-local.sh:82 explicitly
forces FORMAL_REUSE=0. Both the one-byte TLA and changed-pin witnesses re-check;
postsubmit's witness invokes every model and records no reuse.

